{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ceb548e7-10ad-80a5-b0b4-a773bee6ceaa",
  "created_at": "2026-03-11T13:15:41-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kevin Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:13:24-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:13:28-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Pardon me, my name is Kevin Doyle. I'm calling on behalf of my mother about her trash collection."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:13:35-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Kevin. What's going on with the pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:13:39-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Her trash was not collected on the usual day. Her regular day is Tuesday, and yesterday the barrel was at the curb by seven in the morning. It was still full when I stopped by last evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:13:52-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So yesterday, Tuesday, it didn't get picked up. Was it out on the curb the right way, lid closed, nothing blocking it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:14:00-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The lid was closed, and there was nothing near it. Pardon me, I should add that this is the second miss in a row. The collection two weeks ago was skipped as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:14:12-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two in a row, got it. Did anybody leave a tag or a note on the barrel, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:14:19-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, there was no tag and no note. I looked at it carefully both times."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:14:25-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And I need the address for her pickup, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:14:29-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pardon me, I would rather not give the address on this call. Is it possible to report it without one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:14:36-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, I really do need the address so the crew supervisor can look at the route. Could you give me a call back with it, or I can take your number and have someone follow up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:14:48-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The number is four oh one, five five five, oh one five nine. I'm a court stenographer, so I'm usually at the courthouse in the mornings, but I can be reached in the afternoons."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:15:00-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five nine. Afternoons. Okay. I'll note it's a missed pickup on Tuesday, second one in a row, no tag on the barrel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:15:11-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct. Thank you. Pardon me, one more question. Should she leave the barrel out until someone comes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:15:18-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'd leave it out today. If the crew can get back to it, they'll want to find it where it was. Otherwise just bring it in tonight and put it out again next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:15:30-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I will tell her. Thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:15:34-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Kevin. Someone will call you back. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:15:39-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You as well. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
